@local/dsh-file-integrity-check README · dsh-file-integrity-check：The plugin has a white workspace-mapped page in the DSH sidebar, plus a
standalone PowerShell engine that can be used without DSH.

---

@local/dsh-file-integrity-check README · Requirements：- Windows 10 or Windows 11
- DSH 0.2.1 or newer (desktop or web)
- Windows PowerShell 5.1 or PowerShell 7

@local/dsh-file-integrity-check README · 环境要求：- Windows 10 / Windows 11
- DSH 0.2.1 或更新版本
- Windows PowerShell 5.1 或 PowerShell 7

@local/dsh-file-integrity-check README · 开发说明：`scripts/DshWorkspaceAcl.ps1` 必须保存为 **UTF-8 with BOM**；Windows
PowerShell 5.1 没有 BOM 时可能把中文读成乱码并解析失败。没有构建步骤，也不
需要 `node_modules`。
